lready Have Your Money. Agencies are sitting on $5 billion that could sustain","x":270,"y":658,"w":1758,"h":48},{"text":"operations while enacting real reforms. Mega-project capital funds, like for High Speed","x":268,"y":719,"w":1773,"h":45},{"text":"Rail, can be repurposed to cover deficits, without another dime from you. Newsom already","x":271,"y":777,"w":1863,"h":46},{"text":"approved this approach.","x":269,"y":837,"w":499,"h":45},{"text":"• Handing them a $17B revenue stream removes any incentive to reform, consolidate","x":270,"y":930,"w":1813,"h":47},{"text":"bureaucracies, control costs, or utilize automation. This measure asks residents — most of","x":270,"y":989,"w":1846,"h":44},{"text":"whom rarely use transit - to pay more, so transit agencies can change nothing.","x":267,"y":1048,"w":1597,"h":46},{"text":"• Solutions exist without new taxes: Expenses can be cut through part-time and","x":271,"y":1143,"w":1683,"h":43},{"text":"contract labor, vanpools, and partnerships with AV firms.","x":270,"y":1203,"w":1168,"h":43},{"text":"• The Real Problem Is Profound Fiscal Mismanagement. Since 2019, regional transit","x":271,"y":1295,"w":1763,"h":44},{"text":"ridership has plummeted 51%, while operating expenses skyrocketed 28%. Grand Juries in","x":271,"y":1354,"w":1849,"h":46},{"text":"three counties have severely criticized agencies' poor financial controls and oversight.","x":268,"y":1414,"w":1765,"h":44},{"text":"• \"Oversight\" Provisions Are Meaningless: Real accountability requires independent","x":271,"y":1509,"w":1769,"h":45},{"text":"oversight, measurable efficiency targets, and consequences for failing to control costs - all","x":270,"y":1566,"w":1860,"h":47},{"text":"absent here.","x":271,"y":1630,"w":254,"h":34},{"text":"• Your Sales Tax, Their Free Ride: Instead of seeking corporate funding to improve transit,","x":272,"y":1719,"w":1851,"h":45},{"text":"they raise corporate Millions - from PG&E, Meta, Salesforce, Genentech, construction","x":270,"y":1779,"w":1754,"h":46},{"text":"firms, etc. - for this tax campaign, to make residents pay Billions.","x":270,"y":1839,"w":1323,"h":44},{"text":"• Regressive Transit Sales Tax: Impacts Working Families and Seniors the Most","x":273,"y":1934,"w":1642,"h":46},{"text":"VOTE NO: Demand Fixes Before Funding.","x":763,"y":2029,"w":879,"h":42},{"text":"Learn More at https://NoNewTransitTax.com/Solutions","x":618,"y":2123,"w":1176,"h":44},{"text":"FILED","x":944,"y":2383,"w":95,"h":34},{"text":"OFFICE OF THE CHIEF ELECTIONS OFFICER","x":630,"y":2423,"w":728,"h":53},{"text":"SAN MATEO COUNTY","x":820,"y":2477,"w":351,"h":43},{"text":"AUG 1 1","x":865,"y":2595,"w":159,"h":51},{"text":"OFFICER","x":1219,"y":2703,"w":150,"h":38},{"text":"13","x":2235,"y":402,"w":56,"h":75},{"text":"o","x":2244,"y":1220,"w":39,"h":33},{"text":"6","x":2219,"y":1980,"w":39,"h":52}]}]}
